  <item>
    <title>010｜非传统“三角关系”ft. 梁文哲&amp;任彬</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697cd28b2fc7f49d0911e784</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697cd28b2fc7f49d0911e784</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 02:19:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>开播客以来一直想聊一些自己创作之外的事儿，这期正好和两位“测测”超高分认证的好友导演梁文哲&amp;演员任彬聊聊我们仨的非传统”三角关系”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:00:22</a> 开场白总从“怎么认识的”开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">00:09:38</a> 拍电影很难，更最难得的是三向奔赴的“三角关系”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">00:17:40</a> 从“同事”到“这人能处”，我们只用了探班的一个下午</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">00:32:19</a> 非传统浪漫关系的出现，是因为我们不相信爱情了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">00:44:04</a> 把自己藏在别人的生命里，是一种奢侈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">00:51:14</a> &nbsp;谁上台都紧张，演员也不例外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3911">01:05:11</a> &nbsp;“挂脸”有时候可能只是导演的保护色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4261">01:11:01</a> &nbsp;女性心态：老己想要 老己得到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4458">01:14:18</a> 短剧: 一款很新的电子榨菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4811">01:20:11</a> 电影永存！因为我们必须要讲故事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiS9Uw1jFgMiSd4bLu4WJEtZPS4F.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（十月月度相聚记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5WZYEQmH4qFPlZtMm2eslL7VhE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhr18ZEhUJ03K7-_BH7b7bAbmsEX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（十一月月度相聚记录 ft. 电影编剧黄青蕉女士</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvJ3l9SKZIyNvY6wLP_K9nabjMTm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpE7CP4RVP3TJNiZf4T8jtlJmmAr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFRWMuyB6GpE0AD6_wGSycSCWOv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（十二月月度相聚记录 ft. 红霞影剧院巡演</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjVTeIkiEqZFR-9cQm1yMLgh_C3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（今年一月录制现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGCjlce8xIGPU3KdPp8L4VkLoO4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8Tm7XwNsNKOmazXRcxtRGjCW25.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrVx2UE8Ouiy2KM1sVxEUrWGJN7q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（1.28 首映当天</span></p>]]></description>
