    <guid isPermaLink="false">692eab5f3fec3166cfd96206</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Dec 2025 10:19:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期和两位我认识快九年，合作了两张专辑的制作人陆希文(aka本次巡演的音乐总监）+周冠儒，（同时他们也有一个自己音乐的项目@红色草泥斑马）</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊我们彼此相识+长期合作的因缘际会前世今生、两张专辑+两次巡演的成长、以及我们在一起基本上不会触碰的话题——”音乐“本身。</span></p><span></span><p><span>千言万语化作一句： “我叫陈（chen）婧霏+ 周冠(guan)儒+ 陆希(xi)文 ,跟我念一遍。”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEX9Ws7Ie9SfPq_kGIldIU1tP6r.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsS-VUE2gOGruem_jWpZA-wVvRTU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr2chtHJKvh-MUTkbNM7EVEnWBYQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll5lpSSxz8Pew7GrYFx7fW5gLz0f.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGk3GZ1YW6NgWg6UnwOI0z72YVj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（录制当天现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuSTcCROkUSQas7uMNbJjCY1_-0j.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7oK38nSqnw_0jfI6r8SC70gcQQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1eXZH65Z300T9AjcDHUTCB6eYd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2k9qcWCLc-lZexYdYlC0muyWFh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpiaOFN3d3oMKYpGMcAwE7ZnAZS5.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMABwi0-TbtKZCNj4F0ulE8ceHa.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnAWcaTsCGYIUJVWRtTRf6t0QuO8.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmscgC28zUQvgUn728XK9vpbooLH.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（演出一些</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjaWY4047qciObe5mzYmPC1He1QT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu35iAhRpZQL5nwHDfY_DpOFq07Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgw8bWUB1q3HB5-JC7HCcelu9FbK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgs42-Cs56IdsBR54HMJ7ifdmvRI.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfAV8qQbiaEZX_QCT6MHWktUCxB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmZbWMmFZZkwJo2ywT921QUXlV0s.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuBdmLSf6oWzDhwgAh016uoTaAK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（红色草泥斑马一些</span></p>]]></description>
