  <item>
    <title>007｜《剧透》S2E1 “欢迎光临，祝君快乐”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fce14b015672032101cde8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fce14b015672032101cde8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 10:20:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>剧透第二季时隔一年回归。</span></p><span></span><p><span>红霞影剧院大幕即将拉开。新ep, 新主题巡演即将上线。</span></p><span></span><p><span>S2E1 Special episode 婧霏radio Fm121.9</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 红霞剧场cut</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">0:36</a> 墨绿的夜cut1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a> 沙漠一枝花interlude</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">2:08</a> 诸多夏日之后 排练音频（fei’s手机备忘录2024.12.21）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">3:50</a> 墨绿的夜cut2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">4:13</a> First of may 即兴弹唱（fei’s手机备忘录2025.10.19）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">6:13</a> 红霞剧场 即兴弹唱（fei’s手机备忘录2025.8.22）</span></p><span></span><p><span>每首歌的时长、内容都暗藏新的线索和彩蛋。欢迎探索。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期标题灵感：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhvn1JbKnlOQ_GzIFTau9ECZe_gl.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2020年12月底， 在尝试一专《陈婧霏》封面的可能性的时候，我和好朋友一起试着把海报贴到了位于北京酒仙桥附近的已经废弃的红霞影剧院，试图更好地传递那张专辑所讲的主题。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhfw77eGRKRAd2SB8WjvghvBPgjV.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAsCCPCnNmbvNehjHmLyEfdt5h-.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2024 红霞影剧院被拆除， 它的实体只会留存在记忆里。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYp-fQRgjBmmjbPhngsayyokcX4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2025.11 红霞影剧院赛博全息版完成声场的修复与重建。 此工程由主理人陈婧霏负责。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025.12 红霞影剧院限时pop-up版启动。大幕拉开，欢迎光临，祝君快乐。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY96ZpUJ8U9cY0akVXQCeSWYq3Y.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>What a life. 生活真的不可思议。</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划/音频剪辑/图片制作/文案：陈婧霏</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐制作：陆希文、周冠儒</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671732d5db2cf82757049a3a/ljpjt36fFLIKgiDTWYP2XnNdIznF.m4a" length="13774789" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:07:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6WfiTPOz1K3xfVK2HJaoSbRZvc.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>7</itunes:episode>
